OL,3,GNEWSAVillage road safety measures and
OL,4,A20mph limit proposed
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents are being asked to give their
OL,7,Fviews on proposals for new road safety
OL,8,Fmeasures in a village including outside
OL,9,Ftwo schools.
OL,11,FSurrey County Council said it was
OL,12,Fplanning a new pedestrian crossing with
OL,13,Ftraffic lights outside Tillingbourne
OL,14,FJunior School and an uncontrolled
OL,15,Fcrossing outside Chilworth Infant
OL,16,FSchool.
OL,18,FProposals also include a 20mph speed
OL,19,Flimit throughout Chilworth village and
OL,20,Fother traffic calming measures.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
