OL,3,GNEWSAVillage road safety measures and
OL,4,A20mph limit proposed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority said it wanted residents,
OL,7,Fparents, local businesses and everyone
OL,8,Fwho travelled through the village to
OL,9,Fshare their views.
